// 01_single_branch.hcx - converted from .hcx by PHCP 1.0.0.
// Comments in the .hcx file are not carried over.
// Dropped from the .hcx because they had no effect on the result:
//   line 15: OPTIONS TRACE FULL - not an option the .hcx reader acts on

Units    FLOW=LPM PRESSURE=KPA LENGTH=M DIAMETER=MM
Method   HW
Option   TOL_FLOW 0.001
Option   TOL_LOOP 0.0005

Node     N1 0.0
Node     N2 0.0

Use      BORE
Pipe     P1 N1 N2 100.0 100.0 C=120

Supply   SUP1 N1 STATIC 900

Head     S1 N2 K=80 P=50
